   "stem_html": "Describe the transformation shown.<br>\n\n<img src=\"exercises/media/bc4c891e35c58491.png\" alt=\"Two trapezoids are plotted on a rectangular grid. Each trapezoid can be described as follows. The top side measures 3.5. From its right, it goes 2 units bottom-right, then goes 4.5 units left, and then goes 2 units top-left. The first trapezoid is on the left-center of the grid. The second trapezoid is at the top-right of the grid. The first trapezoid is translated 5 units to the right and 5 units vertically.\">\n",
